TIP:  Here in (G) mainly to fingerpick without a capo for a fuller bottom end.  To sing this version with Hank you'd have to capo 9 which is awkwardly confining.

TIP:  If transposing, play the root chord of the transposed (Gadd) adding the 5th note as necessary.

TIP:  To pick out the intro notes of the steel guitar pick the open 4th string (d)>, 4th string/2nd fret (e), and 4th string/4th fret (f#). 
 

